WEBVTT

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.516
FS: But if volleyball ends,

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:35.556
I know that SAP will continue
to support me in whatever I want to do.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:39.766
I think it's just the culture
that we've created here.

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:44.826
AG: It's no surprise that SAP earned
many Employer of Choice awards in 2019.

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:49.066
Check out careers@sap
and visit sap.com/worklife

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:51.233
to learn about experience
management solutions

00:20:51.257 --> 00:20:54.009
for your employees and customers.